  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Centre of Competence For Digital And Artificial Intelligence Skilling in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Regional Centre of Competence for Digital and AI Skilling is a flagship initiative led by the Government of Kenya in collaboration with UNDP and key partners, hosted at the Kenya School of Government. The Centre is designed to strengthen public sector capacity across Africa by equipping civil servants with essential digital and artificial intelligence (AI) skills to accelerate government transformation. It offers tailored, modular training for leaders, technical experts, and frontline staff&#x2014;</narrative>
  </description>
